# the three pianos: the keys light, notes rise, and the effects change the picture
wait 300
turn PRESET -1
turn PRESET -1
turn PRESET -1
turn PRESET -1
turn PRESET -1
turn PRESET -1
turn PRESET -1
expectp PRESET 12
wait 900
tapkey 2
wait 100
key w0 down
key w2 down
key b1 down
wait 260
shot pi_piano.png
key w0 up
key w2 up
key b1 up
wait 300
tapkey 9
tapkey 11
wait 100
shot pi_piano_bars.png
turn PRESET 1
expectp PRESET 13
wait 900
key w4 down
key w6 down
wait 260
shot pi_epiano.png
key w4 up
key w6 up
turn PRESET 1
expectp PRESET 14
wait 900
key w1 down
key w5 down
key b3 down
wait 260
shot pi_organ.png
key w1 up
key w5 up
key b3 up
wait 200
expect page 0
tap FX
turn K3 6
expectp FLUFF >60
